  portrait: {fileID: 3465286685962602723, guid: f2f806ba129fef24397831c4134f6690, type: 3}
  healthPoints: 3
  charDescription: Yakiv Myronenko is the husband of Irina Kuznetsova. Strong and
    protective, he's not easely intimidate and always vigilant. He deals with stress
    by smoking, giving him a bad cough. When talking with him, he rather talk about
    what he miss from the war, but avoid the subject of job, saying he was a Carpenter
    (a lie that can be quite damageable later on). He talk with much respect about
    his wife. His true name is Andriy, a body guard of the superstar Nataliya Honcharova,
    here under the identity of his wife. He's a devoted protector who admired Nataliya
    as she is a very generous and kind person.
  bonus:
  - fort
  - observateur
  - maladroit
  - toujours a deux
